const pr=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(folder,names[1]),'utf8'));
pr.title='Integrate Archive AES and Notes task editing; verify 1,100 implemented checks';
pr.body=`Archive gains AES 7Z, encrypted-header handling and native Windows timestamps. Notes gains saved-note conversion to and from to-dos, completion/reopening, due dates and filters, while retaining drafts, JEX records and resources. Both integrations install exact independently reviewed sources with recoverable before/after journals and pushed pre-installation Git tags.

The current implemented suite passes 1,100/1,100 with zero failures, skips, cancellations or todos. Latest completed run38930461121 verifies the89e source epoch; its complete431-member local backup is readable. Focused Archive acceptance separately passes161 checks and6 Chromium scenarios; installed Notes acceptance passes92 checks and8 Chromium scenarios. Focused/full and repeated campaign counts are never added together. Source authentication, owned cleanup, real response holds, native downloads, preserved failures and original-comparison limits are recorded in the linked verification document.

Direct New to-do creation is a separately verified source experiment. Corrected run38930449217 passes111/111 finite checks and8/8 Chromium scenarios; all1,108 uploaded members have readable recoverable local copies. The complete portable artifacts, raw evidence and independent reviews are public at [R5 experiment evidence](https://github.com/Ginderlax/rea-research-lab/tree/codex/rea-cloud-recovery-20261015/products/rea-studio/results/notes-new-todo-r5-cloud-pass-20261016), committed in d24db80. A source-identical d24 repeat38932306725 also passes111/8 with another complete1,108-member backup. This experiment is not yet installed in the normal32-file Notes application; a separate36-file installation proposal is being authored and must receive source review and fresh committed-source acceptance.

The earlier New to-do failure remains failed107/111 and7/8, with all1,110 members and original observers publicly recoverable in results/notes-new-todo-first-failure-20261016. The narrow runtime correction restores notebook actions during Save while retaining task-operation ownership; strict test corrections compare consistent metadata epochs and strengthen exact raw-byte no-change assertions. No failed receipt is relabelled as a pass. Original Joplin helper comparisons remain separate from full database/GUI behavior; provisional desktop persistence has not been executed.

Latest exact-d24 publication run38932318654 passes208 source controls, both root write/recheck phases and963 syntax checks. Its28,806-file /1,364,428,861-byte payload stays stable; the complete92-file artifact and all56 decoded Notes proof objects are readable locally. Its exact two-file derived metadata import is being independently reviewed before execution. Both earlier publication failures and all historical source identities remain intact. Vault Empty Recycle Bin remains a separate uninstalled233-check experiment with4 KeePass library comparisons.

Builds and product tests run on verified GitHub-hosted Windows. Local work is lightweight authoring, orchestration and recoverable backup verification. No paid resources or billing changes. [Verification details](https://github.com/Ginderlax/rea-research-lab/blob/codex/rea-cloud-recovery-20261015/CLOUD-VERIFICATION.md) retain exact source attribution and limitations. All ten complete replacements, every documented feature and whole-product quality comparisons remain open.`;
fs.writeFileSync(path.join(folder,names[1]),JSON.stringify(pr,null,2)+'\n');
