Work-only authored Empty Recycle Bin experiment. Three reviewed runtime replacements, original20 authored groups unchanged, five adjacent groups and two original-library groups with four separately counted child operations. Valid-bin original fixtures only; actual original UTC is retained and bracketed, not equalized to the candidate single clock. No active installation, original GUI, full-suite, browser, security or comparative acceptance. GPL-2.0-or-later source-assisted contracts reference Vault GROUP-RECYCLE-NOTICE.md. Every current Vault test is in the fixed45-file roster. Manual dispatch only after source review.
// Test-only actual released-library differential; authored, not locally run.
// Named projection contracts follow the already preserved GPL source study.
import test from 'node:test';
import assert from 'node:assert/strict';
import fs from 'node:fs/promises';
import rawFs from 'node:fs';
