The historical [notebook confirmation, drawing layout and editor value API checkpoint](products/rea-studio/NOTES-LAYOUT-VALUE-API-MILESTONE.md) passes **847 implemented-contract checks,0skips and720stable source fingerprints**. Notes passes69focused checks and8browser groups; Sketch39app/2HTTP checks and14browser groups; Editor API13pure checks. Source snapshots, confirmed failures, strictness/precision corrections, independent review and exact historical host transitions remain inspectable. Zero products satisfy the accepted complete replacement and comparative standard.

